// The player's mailbox.
(
    mail: [
        (
            id: "m_welcome",
            from: "mara",
            subject: "your account",
            date: "08/14/1998",
            body: r#"
your account has been restored.

please don't make me regret it.

- m
"#,
        ),
        (
            id: "m_dialtone",
            from: "dialtone",
            subject: "MY DISKS",
            date: "08/13/1998",
            body: r#"
you still have my doom ii disks. all five. i know you're
reading this. the board says you read everything.

give them back or i'm telling mara.

- dt
"#,
        ),
        (
            id: "m_root_notice",
            from: "ROOT",
            subject: "FILE TRANSFER LOGGED",
            date: "{date}",
            body: r#"
TRANSFER: nodelist.txt
NODE:     02
TIME:     {time}

This has been noted.
"#,
        ),
        (
            id: "m_parallax",
            from: "parallax",
            subject: "get off this board",
            date: "{today}",
            body: r#"
whoever you are: hang up.

don't talk to ghost. don't talk to ROOT. and if something
called null offers you anything, say no.

i'm calling from outside. i'm the only one on this board
who still has a pulse, and i'd like to keep it that way.

you should check whether you do.

- P
"#,
            on_read: [Add("burner", 1), Add("paranoia", 1)],
        ),
        (
            id: "m_null_gift",
            from: "null",
            subject: "0x08",
            date: "--/--/----",
            body: r#"
locks have bugs.

  open 08 --force

ROOT will notice. ROOT always notices. so what.
"#,
            on_read: [Set("null_hint_force")],
        ),
    ],
)
